      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After the institution sacrificed its leader to appease the masses, the rebel fixer imposed order from chaos, steering the team stripped of its stars past the regime's initial challengers. This underdog narrative culminated in a hard-fought playoff series win, but ultimately the establishment's chosen victor asserted the system's total dominion, sweeping the weakened challenger and advancing to the championship round.",
