    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Injuries decimated the team's core, creating the scenario for the institution's desperate management decision. The hired gun brought in to salvage a sinking ship oversaw a strong finish and led the team through early playoff rounds, proving the insurgent leader's merit. However, the favored establishment crushed the weakened rebel with a low-scoring defensive game, completing the series sweep and ensuring the entrenched power advanced to the ultimate stage.",
