    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The sports franchise, reeling from player injury that cost its key assets, made a late-season coaching change. The professional coach they installed guided a winning record and playoff coaching success, leading team advancement to the conference final. Yet the NHL team that won a low-scoring defensive game asserted dominance, securing their playoff advancement and sweeping the series in four straight games.",
